  {
    "id": 3004009020050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ま、摩美々～！\r\nそいはうちが育てよった肉～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー\r\nなんのことー？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、いたずら姫はお腹が空いているようだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ん～！　焼きパイン最高！\r\nほらほら、さくやんときりりんも食べて！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020090,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "うん……\r\n初めまして……焼きパインさん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020100,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "ふふ……\r\n熱くて……甘い……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、香ばしく焼き上がった表面と\r\nジューシーな果肉のハーモニー……まさに絶品だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "咲耶ぁ\r\nそれ、こっちにもー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちも～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……まぁ、焼きパインではしゃいだ三峰が言うのも\r\nなんなんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "せっかくツイスタ映えしそうな\r\nおしゃれバーベキューなのに、いつも通りだよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "部活帰りのファミレス、みたいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、美味しいものを美味しく頂く乙女の様は\r\nいつだって美しいものだよ、結華",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ちょっと咲耶ぁ\r\nパイン早くー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、うまか～！\r\n霧子、こっちも食べんね！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020200,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "うん……\r\nありがとう……恋鐘ちゃん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──まぁ、美味しく食べるのより\r\n優先されることなんてないか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3004009020220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ほらほら、ちゃんと人数分あるんだから、\r\nみんな落ち着いてー？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300400902/3004009020220"
  },
